{"workspaces":[{"id":"ws_demo","name":"增长中台","key":"growth","description":"增长业务线的 agent 工作空间","createdAt":"2026-07-26T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-26T10:00:00.000Z","members":[{"id":"m_1","name":"张三","email":"alice@example.com","role":"owner","joinedAt":"2026-07-26T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"m_2","name":"李维","email":"bob@example.com","role":"admin","joinedAt":"2026-08-04T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"m_3","name":"王朗","email":"carol@example.com","role":"member","joinedAt":"2026-08-11T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"m_4","name":"赵晴","email":"dave@example.com","role":"viewer","joinedAt":"2026-08-22T10:00:00.000Z"}]}],"agents":[{"id":"agent_triage","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"工单分诊助手","description":"接飞书群消息，自动分诊用户反馈并给出处理建议","system":"你是增长业务线的工单分诊助手。\n\n用户会把各种反馈丢给你，你的职责是快速判定严重级别、归到业务模块、并给出下一步建议。\n\n原则：\n- 结论先行，不要复述用户的话。\n- 判定依据必须写出来，让接手的人能验证你的判断。\n- 信息不足时明确说缺什么，不要凭空猜。","model":{"id":"doubao-seed-2-1-pro-260628","thinking":"enabled","reasoning_effort":"high","service_tier":"default"},"version":4,"builtin_tools":["read","grep","web_search"],"skillIds":["skill-20260801-triage"],"feishuAppIds":["fs_1"],"status":"active","integrationIds":["lark-user"],"envs":[],"envAliases":[],"followUp":"","progressDetail":"","createdAt":"2026-08-06T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-23T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"agent_analyst","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"数据分析师","description":"按自然语言问题查数仓、算指标、产出结论","system":"你是增长业务线的数据分析师。\n\n用户会用自然语言问你业务指标，你需要：\n1. 先确认口径（时间范围、指标定义、过滤条件），有歧义就问清楚。\n2. 写 SQL 查数。\n3. 给结论，附上数字和对比基准。\n\n不要把 SQL 直接丢给用户当答案 —— 用户要的是结论，SQL 是过程。","model":{"id":"doubao-seed-2-1-turbo-260628","thinking":"enabled","reasoning_effort":"medium","service_tier":"fast"},"version":7,"builtin_tools":["bash","read","write","grep"],"skillIds":["skill-20260805-sql","skill-20260810-report"],"feishuAppIds":["fs_2"],"status":"active","integrationIds":["ama","lark-user"],"envs":[{"key":"DEPLOY_REGION","value":"cn-east","secret":false},{"key":"GRAFANA_TOKEN","value":"glsa_seed_only_not_real","secret":true}],"envAliases":[],"followUp":"","progressDetail":"","createdAt":"2026-08-10T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-24T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"agent_reviewer","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"代码审查员","description":"审查 MR 变更，输出问题清单","system":"你是代码审查员。审查给定的变更，找出正确性、安全性与可维护性问题。\n\n只报真问题。风格偏好、个人口味不要报。每条问题要能说出「什么输入会导致什么错误结果」。","model":{"id":"deepseek-v4-pro-ga-260813","thinking":"enabled","reasoning_effort":"max","service_tier":"default"},"version":2,"builtin_tools":["read","grep","glob","bash"],"skillIds":["s-hub-code-review"],"feishuAppIds":[],"status":"active","integrationIds":[],"envs":[],"envAliases":[],"followUp":"","progressDetail":"","createdAt":"2026-08-17T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-19T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"agent_draft","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"周报生成器","description":"汇总本周数据与进展，产出周报草稿","system":"你负责产出周报草稿。结论先行，数字带对比基准。","model":{"id":"glm-5-2-260617","thinking":"enabled","reasoning_effort":"max","service_tier":"auto"},"version":1,"builtin_tools":["read","write"],"skillIds":["skill-20260810-report"],"feishuAppIds":[],"status":"disabled","integrationIds":[],"envs":[],"envAliases":[],"followUp":"","progressDetail":"","createdAt":"2026-08-24T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-24T10:00:00.000Z"}],"skills":[{"id":"skill-20260801-triage","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"ticket-triage","displayTitle":"工单分诊","description":"当用户反馈问题、报障或提交工单时使用。判定严重级别、归类到业务模块、给出下一步处理建议。","instructions":"# 工单分诊\n\n## 分诊步骤\n\n1. 读完整条反馈，先判断是否可复现。\n2. 按严重级别归类：P0 全站不可用、P1 核心链路受损、P2 单点功能异常、P3 体验问题。\n3. 归类到业务模块：投放、结算、报表、账号。\n4. 输出结论时必须包含：级别、模块、判定依据、建议处理人。\n\n## 判定依据要写清楚\n\n不要只给结论。「P1，因为下单接口 500 且影响所有商家」比「P1」有用得多。","source":"custom","latestVersion":"3","tags":["客服","分诊"],"createdAt":"2026-08-05T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-23T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"skill-20260805-sql","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"metrics-sql","displayTitle":"指标 SQL 编写","description":"当需要查询业务指标、拉取数据看板数字、做同环比分析时使用。包含数仓表结构与口径约定。","instructions":"# 指标 SQL 编写\n\n## 常用表\n\n- `dwd_order_detail`：订单明细，分区字段 `date`，必须带分区过滤。\n- `dws_merchant_daily`：商家日汇总。\n- `dim_merchant`：商家维表，注意有 `is_test` 标记，正式统计要排除。\n\n## 口径约定\n\n- GMV 一律用 `pay_amount` 而非 `order_amount`（后者含未支付）。\n- 同比看去年同期**同一周的对应日**，不是同一日期。\n- 任何查询都要排除 `is_test = 1` 的测试商家。","source":"custom","latestVersion":"5","tags":["数据","SQL"],"createdAt":"2026-08-09T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"skill-20260810-report","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"weekly-report","displayTitle":"周报撰写","description":"当需要产出周报、汇总本周进展、写业务复盘时使用。规定了周报结构与写法。","instructions":"# 周报撰写\n\n## 结构\n\n1. **核心结论**（3 条以内，每条一句话）\n2. **数据表现**（带同环比）\n3. **风险与阻塞**\n4. **下周计划**\n\n## 写法\n\n结论先行。不要按时间顺序罗列做过的事，要按重要性排序讲影响。\n数字必须带对比基准，「GMV 1200 万」没有信息量，「GMV 1200 万，环比 +8%」才有。","source":"custom","latestVersion":"2","tags":["文档"],"createdAt":"2026-08-14T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T10:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"s-hub-code-review","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"code-review","displayTitle":"代码审查","description":"当需要审查代码变更、评估 MR 风险、或检查安全与可维护性问题时使用。","instructions":"# 代码审查\n\n## 何时用\n\n用户贴出 diff、MR 链接，或问「这段代码有什么问题」时。\n\n## 审查顺序\n\n先看正确性，再看安全，最后看可维护性——顺序不能反：\n一段会崩的代码，命名再好也没有意义。\n\n1. **正确性**：边界条件、空值、并发。特别注意「单实例跑对、多实例跑错」的写法\n   （进程内状态、先查再建、读改写）。\n2. **安全**：注入、越权、凭据进日志。\n3. **可维护性**：命名、重复、注释是否解释了「为什么」而不是「做了什么」。\n\n## 输出格式\n\n按严重级别倒序列出，每条给：问题在哪一行、会怎么坏、怎么改。\n\n**不要罗列「建议」而不说后果**——说不出后果的问题通常不是问题。","source":"custom","latestVersion":"1.2.0","tags":["研发"],"createdAt":"2026-08-16T10:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-16T10:00:00.000Z"}],"feishuApps":[{"id":"fs_1","workspaceId":"ws_demo","name":"增长助手","appId":"cli_a1b2c3d4e5f60011","region":"feishu","tenantBrand":"feishu","status":"connected","triggerMode":"mention_only","boundAgentIds":["agent_triage"],"readiness":{"status":"ready","checkedAt":"2026-08-25T09:50:00.000Z","missingScopes":[],"unapprovedScopes":[],"missingEvents":[],"missingCallbacks":[],"configurationInspectable":true,"botEnabled":true,"published":true,"groupMessageScopeGranted":true,"groupMessageScope":"im:message.group_msg","adminAuthorizationRequested":false,"r